<title>UK: Midland Bank sets 150 mln stg bond.</title>
<headline>Midland Bank sets 150 mln stg bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager HSBC Markets.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MIDLAND BANK PLC</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN STG   COUPON     **	  MATURITY   *PERPETUAL</p>
<p> TYPE   STEP-UP PERP  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    23.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.625     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+87 BP</p>
<p> NOTES   ** TO BE PRICED OVER 7.25 PCT 2007 GILT</p>
<p>	    * CALL EVERY FIVE YEARS AT PAR FROM 07.DEC.07, WHEN</p>
<p>		COUPON STEPS UP TO +187 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	A1	  LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A-	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 7.25 PCT GILT DUE 2007</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF DEBT ISSUANCE PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
